Conditions.ArmsDealerNearNurse: With the Nurse nearby

WelcomeMessage: {
	TBRNotice: NOTICE: Make sure the Health, Damage, & Speed multipliers are set to 1 (default) in the compatibility config of Thorium Bosses Reworked (unless you want a harder experience), as this mod automatically adjusts the Thorium bosses depending on the current difficulty.
	RagnarokBalance: NOTICE: For the Balancing of weapons to be as intended, set the Ragnarok mod config of 'Generic Weapon Tweaks' to OFF, as otherwise the changes will stack and weapons will be far stronger than intended.
	CalamityBardHealerBalance: NOTICE: For the Balancing of weapons to be as intended, set the Unofficial Calamity Bard & Healer mod config of 'General Item Balance Changes' to OFF, as otherwise the changes will stack and weapons will be far stronger than intended.
}
